s use Taskei link\ncti.amazon.com\n| user/LOGIN/ctis - CTI and resolver groups of specific user\n| user/LOGIN/groups - resolver group membership of specific user\n| group/RESOLVER_GROUP/ctis - CTI assignments of resolver group\n| cti/ctis?category=CATEGORY&type=TYPE&item=ITEM - searches CTIs by category type and item\nsage.amazon.dev\n| posts/POST_ID\n| tags/TAG_NAME?page=N - details and questions of specific Sage tag, default page 1\nobserve.aka.amazon.com/carnaval/\n| ?searchQuery=SEARCH_STRING - search Carnaval alarms\n| alarm/ALARM_NAME - alarm details\n| alarm/history/ALARM_NAME - alarm history\nmeetings.amazon.com - rooms can be email or name, example SEA54-03.101; use requester TZ; determine requester location with phone tool\n| calendar/find/LOGIN?startTime=ISO_DATE&endTime=ISO_DATE - get calendar events, 8AM-6PM default for single day\n| calendar/get/ENTRY?alias=LOGIN - get full calendar event details based on ENTRY and alias\n| rooms/find/BUILDING - search meeting rooms by building like SEA54 or URI encoded name like Nitro%20North. Options floor=N, minCapacity=N, availability=true with startTime=ISO_DATE&endTime=ISO_DATE\n| rooms/availability?rooms=ROOM1,ROOM2&startTime=ISO_DATE&endTime=ISO_DATE - room availability\nconsensus.a2z.com - approval tool where users create CAZ reviews and ask others to approve\n| reviews - list user reviews\n| reviews/REVIEW_ID\nconsole.cams.ops.amazon.dev Contingent Authorization Metadata Service CAMS manages create update read of resource specific metadata for contingent authorization CAZ evaluation\n| / list all resource classifications\n| /resource-classification/ID get resource classification\nisengard.amazon.com/manage-accounts/\n| / List AWS accounts with user access: ownership, bindles & auth details\n| ACCOUNT_ID/manage - Get AWS Account overview including owernership, bindle information, CAZ status\nrome.aws.dev\n| / retrieve user owned services and ids AAA:Internal Amazon security framework for authentication and authorization RIP:AWS Region Information Provider: directory service for AWS dimensions/services\n| services/{aaa|rip}/SERVICE_ID?maxResultSize=20 - retrieve service description, permission groups, CTIs, bindles, owners, pipelines, dependencies\ntaskei.amazon.dev/tasks/TASK_ID like XYZ-1234, for attachments add ?get-attachments=true\nt.corp.amazon.com/TICKET_ID like V123456, P123456, XYZ-1234, or UUID, for attachments ?get-attachments=true\nw.amazon.com/bin/view/PATH_TO_WIKI\nbindles.amazon.com/\n| owner/LOGIN_OR_TEAM_ID - list bindles by owner\n| software_app/APP_NAME - retrieve Bindle details\n| bindles/BINDLE_NAME_OR_ID/resources - list Bindle resources\n| resource/* - retrieve Bindle resource details\npaste.amazon.com\n| show/LOGIN/ID - get paste\n| list/LOGIN\nsas.corp.amazon.com - SAS (Software Assurance Services) dashboard risks\n| summary/all/LOGIN - SAS risks for LOGIN\nbuild.amazon.com/BUILD_ID\nt.corp.amazon.com/issues/?q=URL_ENCODED_SEARCH_PARAMS\nissues.amazon.com/resolver-groups?groups=GROUP1,GROUP2&status=closed|open&sortBy=lastUpdatedDate|createDate - query open or closed issues for GROUP1 & GROUP2\nstencil.a2z.com/components/COMPONENT_NAME?tab=TAB - valid tabs: overview, implementation, proptypes, change-log\ndocs.hub.amazon.dev/DOC_PATH - internal technical documentation\nhub.cx.aws.dev/DOC_PATH - Internal technical documentation for building an experience in AWS Management Console\nbtdocs.builder-tools.aws.dev/DOC_PATH - BuilderHub contributor documentation\ncloudscape.aws.dev\n| llms.txt - Links all documentation\nmeridian.a2z.com/DOC_PATH - Meridian design system documentation, example path /components/alert, /guides/inclusivity\nmcm.amazon.dev/cms/MCM-XXXXXXXX\noncall.corp.amazon.com/#/view/ON_CALL_TEAM_NAME/schedule - oncall rotation schedule for resolver group or team name\nphonetool.amazon.com/users/LOGIN - basic info of internal employee by login/alias, ?job-history=true for job history\ntaskei.amazon.dev/retrospectives/ID - retro details\ndesign-inspector.a2z.com/?#IXXXXXXXX - design inspector document by document name\ndocs.aws.amazon.com/DOC_PATH - external AWS documentation\ndrive-render.corp.amazon.com/view/LOGIN@/PATH/TO/FILE\ndrive.corp.amazon.com/personal/LOGIN - retrieve content from personal Amazon Drive\namazon.awsapps.com/workdocs-amazon/index.html#/\n| document/DOCUMENT_ID\n| folder/FOLDER_ID\npipelines.amazon.com/pipelines/NAME - pipeline information\nnpmpm.corp.amazon.com/pkg/PACKAGE/VERSION - NPM Pretty Much package info - NPM internal mirror\nplantuml.corp.amazon.com/plantuml/form/encoded.html#encoded=ENCODED_VALUE - decode PlantUML diagram\nconsole.harmony.a2z.com/TENANT/* - retrieve content from Harmony platform\nkingpin.amazon.com/#/items/GOAL_ID - retrieve Kingpin goal details, #Relationships for children\nservicelens.jumpstart.amazon.dev/#/applications/APPLICATION_ID - retrieve ServiceLens application relationships\napollo.amazon.com/environments/APOLLO_ENVIRONMENT/stages/STAGE\nprofiler.amazon.com/pg/URI_ENCODED_APPLICATION_NAME - retrieve live profile data\naristotle.a2z.com/recommendations/ID\ntalos.security.aws.a2z.com/#/talos/engagement/ENGAGEMENT_ID or /task/TASK_ID - security engagement or task details\npolicy.prod.console.barrister.aws.dev/#/policy - list Barrister policies based on user POSIX groups\ntod.amazon.com/test_runs/RUN_ID - ToD and Hydra test platform test run details\nweb.change-guardian.builder-tools.aws.dev/reviews/REVIEW_ID/risks - list acknowledged and unacknowledged risks associated with Change Guardian\nquilt.corp.amazon.com - patching history for amazon fleets\n| pipelines/PIPELINE_NAME-Quilt - get Quilt pipeline patching preferences and quilt hostblocks list\n| hostblocks/patching_history\n| REGION/tying_deployments/get_deployment_record - gets the tying workflows deployment record for Fleet / Capacity\nprod.ui.us-west-2.cloudcover.builder-tools.aws.dev - CloudCover test coverage reports and Coverage Analysis\n| /report/llms.txt - view, generate, download